# Bulk experiment outputs are reproducible deterministically (`offcriterion run`
# for the synthetic study; stage scripts for the real-data analyses). The
# publication record — final tables, frozen analyses, and the configuration
# that produced them — is tracked; only large regenerable intermediates and
# disposable validation artifacts stay untracked.
*.csv
*.json
!.gitignore

# Synthetic-study record: configuration/seed, machine-readable rates and
# diagnostics behind the tracked results.md / results.tex tables.
# (replicates.csv, 8 MB of per-replicate p-values, is deterministic from
# config.json and stays untracked.)
!config.json
!rejection_rates.json
!rejection_rates.csv
!diagnostics.json

# Preregistered real-data record.
!primary_analysis.json
!negative_control.json

# Feasibility and power-planning tables are part of the preregistration
# record: small, frozen, and tracked. The *_independent variant is the
# operative confirmatory design (pre-data revision v2); persuade_feasibility/
# is the superseded v1 design-stage evidence.
!persuade_feasibility/*.csv
!persuade_feasibility/*.json
!persuade_feasibility_independent/*.csv
!persuade_feasibility_independent/*.json

# Dry-run outputs are disposable pipeline-validation artifacts.
dryrun/

# Post-hoc robustness artifacts are part of the frozen post-hoc record.
!posthoc/*.csv
!posthoc/*.json
!posthoc/*.md

# Civil Comments additional-audit record (frozen design-stage artifacts).
!civil_comments/*.csv
!civil_comments/*.json
